{"seq":3,"slug":"fta-utilization-saving-metric","title":"协定享惠率与关税节省度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-verification-risk/fta-utilization-saving-metric","wordCount":2018,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"协定享惠率与关税节省度量\">协定享惠率与关税节省度量</h1><p>一套原产地系统值不值得继续投入，最终要用两个数字回答：本该享惠的货里有多少真的享了惠，以及总共省下了多少钱。这两个指标看起来简单，算错的方式却很多——分母怎么界定、基准税率取哪个、漏损怎么识别。算错了，优化方向就会指错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>享惠度量要回答三个层面的问题：覆盖面（有多少货走了优惠通道）、有效性（节省了多少）、以及漏损（有多少本该享惠却没享）。它同时是前三章的验收口径——判定标准是否落在正确的宽严度、数据链是否完整、凭证路径是否顺畅，最终都会反映在这组数字上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[可享惠货物总量] --&gt; B[实际享惠]&#10;  A --&gt; C[漏损]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[资格可用但未申请]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[判定失败但可补救]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[凭证问题被拒]&#10;  B --&gt; D[节省额计算]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[基准税率 MFN]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[协定税率]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[附加措施修正]&#10;  A --&gt; E[享惠率 = B / A]\">graph TD\n  A[可享惠货物总量] --&gt; B[实际享惠]\n  A --&gt; C[漏损]\n  C --&gt; C1[资格可用但未申请]\n  C --&gt; C2[判定失败但可补救]\n  C --&gt; C3[凭证问题被拒]\n  B --&gt; D[节省额计算]\n  D --&gt; D1[基准税率 MFN]\n  D --&gt; D2[协定税率]\n  D --&gt; D3[附加措施修正]\n  A --&gt; E[享惠率 = B / A]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>享惠率</td>\n<td>实际享惠货值 / 可享惠货值</td>\n<td>报关 + 判定结论</td>\n<td>分母用全部出口货值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关税节省额</td>\n<td>Σ 货值 ×(基准税率 − 协定税率)</td>\n<td>关税表 + 报关</td>\n<td>基准取零或取错版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏损额</td>\n<td>可享惠但未享惠的税额</td>\n<td>判定结论 diff</td>\n<td>只算未申请，忽略被拒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补救收益</td>\n<td>经补救后新增的节省</td>\n<td>择优结果</td>\n<td>未扣补救成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净节省</td>\n<td>节省额 − 补救成本 − 被追征</td>\n<td>综合</td>\n<td>未扣被追征金额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"享惠率的分母界定\">享惠率的分母界定</h2><h3 id=\"分母是-可享惠-而非-全部出口\">分母是「可享惠」而非「全部出口」</h3><p>把全部出口货值当分母会系统性低估享惠率，因为大量货物根本不在任何协定覆盖范围内。正确的分母是「客观上具备享惠可能的货值」——即至少在一个适用协定下通过原产判定的货值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两种口径\">两种口径</h3><p>分母有两种合理口径，用途不同。<strong>判定口径</strong>以判定引擎结论中「QUALIFIED」的批次货值为分母，反映系统内部的转化效率。<strong>资格口径</strong>以理论上符合条件的货值为分母，还要包含「判定失败但可通过补救达标」的部分，反映业务潜力。做管理决策时用资格口径，做系统调试时用判定口径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时点对齐\">时点对齐</h3><p>分子与分母必须对齐到同一期间与同一批次定义。常见错误是分子按报关日期统计、分母按出运日期统计，跨月批次会产生虚假波动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"享惠率是国际通行的分析维度\">享惠率是国际通行的分析维度</h3><p>「可享惠贸易中有多大比例真正使用了优惠」是各国海关与国际贸易机构共同关注的分析维度，也是判断原产地规则是否构成隐性贸易壁垒的核心证据之一。ITC 与 WCO、WTO 合作维护的规则查询工具把「detailed rules of origin」与「duty savings」并列呈现，正是为了让出口商能同时看到规则与收益（<a href=\"https://findrulesoforigin.org/home/help\">ITC Rules of Origin Facilitator</a>）。对企业而言，这意味着享惠率不只是一个内部 KPI，而是可以与外部数据源交叉验证的指标——如果你的享惠率显著低于同类企业的公开水平，通常说明流程或数据链存在问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"节省额的计算\">节省额的计算</h2><h3 id=\"基准税率的选择\">基准税率的选择</h3><p>基准是目的国对该货物的最惠国税率（MFN），不是零、不是历史税率、也不是任何单边优惠后的税率。选错基准会直接放大或缩小节省额。三种修正必须处理：目的国已有单边更低优惠（基准应取更低者）、货物本身零关税（节省为零，应排除以避免稀释指标）、以及存在反倾销等附加措施（应从节省中扣除附加部分）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从量与复合税\">从量与复合税</h3><p>从量税品类不能套用从价公式。节省额按数量计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Saving</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>MFN</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>FTA</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Saving} = Q \\times (t_{\\text{MFN}} - t_{\\text{FTA}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Saving</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MFN</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FTA</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>复合税（从价加从量）需两项分别计算后相加。混用会导致个别品类节省额出现数量级错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"汇率与时点\">汇率与时点</h3><p>货值用报关时适用的汇率折算，不能用期初或期末汇率。多币种业务中汇率口径不统一是节省额与财务账对不上的常见原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"漏损识别\">漏损识别</h2><h3 id=\"三类漏损\">三类漏损</h3><p>漏损不止「没申请」一种。第一类是<strong>资格可用但未申请</strong>，企业不知道或懒得申请。第二类是<strong>判定失败但可补救</strong>，即第二章缺口分析里标记为「短期可达成」的那些。第三类是<strong>凭证问题被拒</strong>，判定合格但因凭证形式、运输或数据问题被进口国拒绝。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用判定结论做差集\">用判定结论做差集</h3><p>漏损识别的核心操作是一次集合差：以「判定为 QUALIFIED」的批次减去「实际享惠」的批次，得到候选漏损；再对候选集做归因，落到三类中的某一类。这个差集必须基于同一批次的标识（出运单号或批次号），否则会对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 漏损候选集：判定合格但实际未享惠&#10;SELECT v.sku, v.batch, v.agreement, s.duty_value,&#10;       s.duty_value * (r.mfn_rate - v.applied_rate) AS forgone_saving&#10;FROM origin_verdict v&#10;JOIN shipment s        ON s.batch = v.batch AND s.sku = v.sku&#10;JOIN agreement_rate r  ON r.agreement = v.agreement&#10;                      AND r.hs6 = v.hs6 AND r.destination = s.destination&#10;LEFT JOIN preference_claim pc ON pc.batch = v.batch AND pc.sku = v.sku&#10;WHERE v.verdict = &#39;QUALIFIED&#39;&#10;  AND pc.batch IS NULL&#10;  AND s.ship_date &gt;= :period_start AND s.ship_date &lt; :period_end;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 漏损候选集：判定合格但实际未享惠</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">agreement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">duty_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">duty_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mfn_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">applied_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forgone_saving</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin_verdict v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment s        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agreement_rate r  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">agreement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">agreement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hs6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hs6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">destination</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> preference_claim pc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verdict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'QUALIFIED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ship_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ship_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :period_end;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"归因的必要性\">归因的必要性</h3><p>差集只给出候选，归因才决定行动。资格可用未申请的，行动是流程改造；判定失败可补救的，行动是供应链或规则配置调整；凭证被拒的，行动是单证质量整改，见 <a href=\"../certificate-declaration/certificate-issue-record-retention\">证书签发流程与单证保存（联131）</a>。三类混在一起看会得出「漏损很多但不知从何下手」的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"净收益与真实价值\">净收益与真实价值</h2><h3 id=\"扣除项\">扣除项</h3><p>从节省额中要扣除三项才能得到净收益：补救成本（改供应商、改设计的投入）、被追征金额（核查失败的补税与滞纳金）、以及系统运营成本（人力、签证费、数据采集成本）。只报节省额不报扣除项，会把指标变成宣传数字。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NetBenefit</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Saving</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>remedy</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>Recovery</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetBenefit} = \\text{Saving} - C_{\\text{remedy}} - \\text{Recovery} - C_{\\text{ops}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetBenefit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Saving</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remedy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recovery</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"被追征的处理\">被追征的处理</h3><p>核查导致的补税应从同年度的节省额中扣回。若企业把「已享惠」当作已实现收益而忽略后续被追征，指标会在核查年份出现无法解释的缺口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间维度\">时间维度</h3><p>节省是流量指标，应按时段统计以便比较；系统投入是存量的，要摊到各期。两者混算会让初期看起来极不划算、后期又过于好看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标驱动的改进\">指标驱动的改进</h2><h3 id=\"从指标到行动\">从指标到行动</h3><p>三个指标各指向不同行动：享惠率低而漏损以「资格可用未申请」为主，说明流程与意识问题；漏损以「判定失败可补救」为主，说明供应链与规则配置是瓶颈；节省额与财务对不上，说明口径与数据链路问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层看指标\">分层看指标</h3><p>整体享惠率会掩盖结构差异。应按 HS 大类、目的市场、供应商分层看，问题往往集中在少数几层。全公司 92% 的享惠率可能掩盖某个重点品类只有 60% 的事实。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指标不宜直接考核\">指标不宜直接考核</h3><p>把享惠率直接挂到个人考核会诱导刷数字——例如把可享惠范围人为缩小以提高比率，或对边界批次强行出证。指标应当用于定位问题，处置问题则应回到判定与证据的实质。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>享惠率的分母是「可享惠」而非全部出口，分判定口径与资格口径两种用途。</li>\n<li>节省额的基准是最惠国税率，需处理单边优惠、零关税、附加措施三类修正。</li>\n<li>从量税与复合税按数量或分项计算，不能套用从价公式。</li>\n<li>漏损分三类：资格可用未申请、判定失败可补救、凭证问题被拒，必须归因后行动。</li>\n<li>净收益 = 节省 − 补救成本 − 被追征 − 运营成本，缺扣除项则指标失真。</li>\n<li>指标应分层查看并用于定位问题，不宜直接作为个人考核目标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协定享惠率与关税节省度量","id":"协定享惠率与关税节省度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"享惠率的分母界定","id":"享惠率的分母界定"},{"level":3,"text":"分母是「可享惠」而非「全部出口」","id":"分母是-可享惠-而非-全部出口"},{"level":3,"text":"两种口径","id":"两种口径"},{"level":3,"text":"时点对齐","id":"时点对齐"},{"level":3,"text":"享惠率是国际通行的分析维度","id":"享惠率是国际通行的分析维度"},{"level":2,"text":"节省额的计算","id":"节省额的计算"},{"level":3,"text":"基准税率的选择","id":"基准税率的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"从量与复合税","id":"从量与复合税"},{"level":3,"text":"汇率与时点","id":"汇率与时点"},{"level":2,"text":"漏损识别","id":"漏损识别"},{"level":3,"text":"三类漏损","id":"三类漏损"},{"level":3,"text":"用判定结论做差集","id":"用判定结论做差集"},{"level":3,"text":"归因的必要性","id":"归因的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"净收益与真实价值","id":"净收益与真实价值"},{"level":3,"text":"扣除项","id":"扣除项"},{"level":3,"text":"被追征的处理","id":"被追征的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"时间维度","id":"时间维度"},{"level":2,"text":"指标驱动的改进","id":"指标驱动的改进"},{"level":3,"text":"从指标到行动","id":"从指标到行动"},{"level":3,"text":"分层看指标","id":"分层看指标"},{"level":3,"text":"指标不宜直接考核","id":"指标不宜直接考核"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"经核准出口商合规与自主声明管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-verification-risk/authorized-exporter-compliance"},"next":null}